{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/曙月•月出星隐","pageid":5296,"revid":12477,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%9B%99%E6%9C%88%E2%80%A2%E6%9C%88%E5%87%BA%E6%98%9F%E9%9A%90&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%9B%99%E6%9C%88%E2%80%A2%E6%9C%88%E5%87%BA%E6%98%9F%E9%9A%90&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%9B%99%E6%9C%88%E2%80%A2%E6%9C%88%E5%87%BA%E6%98%9F%E9%9A%90&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>曙月•月出星隐</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E6.9B.99.E6.9C.88.E2.80.A2.E6.9C.88.E5.87.BA.E6.98.9F.E9.9A.90\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"曙月•月出星隐\"><b>曙月•月出星隐</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 曙月•月出星隐.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f9/4yq0p7d4p8lckkhiat6w266t6u5ai3l.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%9B%99%E6%9C%88%E2%80%A2%E6%9C%88%E5%87%BA%E6%98%9F%E9%9A%90.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f9/4yq0p7d4p8lckkhiat6w266t6u5ai3l.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%9B%99%E6%9C%88%E2%80%A2%E6%9C%88%E5%87%BA%E6%98%9F%E9%9A%90.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/f9/4yq0p7d4p8lckkhiat6w266t6u5ai3l.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />曙月•月出星隐\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>4\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-3十字\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓1-↑1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>3X3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（物理伤害）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]，选择自身十字范围内<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>个地点，冲锋至该地点并对范围1圈内所有目标造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">60%</font>[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">范围伤害</span>]，施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"易伤2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">易伤2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"缴械\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">缴械</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合；若自身拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"值守\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">值守</font></span></span>]，伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>。技能若只命中<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>个敌人，则造成伤害提高至<font color=\"#ed7950\">120%</font>。若击败目标，则返还能量消耗和冷却，每回合最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-3十字 3X3.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/4f/6h8odcfud1jc5gdh2hakk3jnl1m7oi1.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-3%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97_3X3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/4f/6h8odcfud1jc5gdh2hakk3jnl1m7oi1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%88%B1%E8%8E%8E\" title=\"角色图鉴库/爱莎\"><img alt=\"头像 爱莎.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/4b/avapqa2vuo6ernxve07pidnrhletzcc.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">爱莎</font></div>\n</di